    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Hey buddy, buddy, tell me, which panda do you think is the cutest in the world?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you say "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Meng Lan",
            "zh": "萌兰"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "? Haha, I’m "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " many of you did! "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " I was born in July 2015, I’ve been the cutest, smartest, friendliest, and most handsome panda in the world!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, I’m living at the Beijing Zoo. I’m the most "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " panda here. Do you want to see me? Well, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rush",
            "ref": "v-rush"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " towards me as soon as the zoo opens at 7:30 am! If you’re not a good runner, then I’m "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the only thing you’re going to be able to see is a very large "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "crowd",
            "ref": "v-crowd"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " outside of my room."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’m also the busiest (my keepers use the word “naughtiest”, but I think it should be “busiest”) panda in the zoo. I’ve kept a few birds as my "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". I "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them daily. Most of them have become as chubby"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "胖乎乎的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and cute as me. I enjoy digging tunnels in my room, too. However, every time I do this, my keepers come inside of my room and stand behind me. Then, I have to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "pretend",
            "ref": "v-pretend"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " that I’m "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " some grass to eat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’m also "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " working out. I’m good at doing "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "splits",
            "zh": "劈叉"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", and I do "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sit-ups",
            "zh": "仰卧起坐"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " almost every day. I’ve even tried to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the wall of my room. I want to shake hands with my fans! Every time my keepers tell me not to do this, I "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " my head. But as soon as they’re gone, I start planning out my next climb!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I enjoy being the cutest, smartest, friendliest, and most handsome panda in the world! Come to Beijing and see me!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
